{"id":"colline","lemma":"colline","pos":"noun","rank":2693,"glosses":["hill, downs"],"ipa":"/kɔ.lin/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/7/79/Fr-colline.ogg/Fr-colline.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"collines"},"formAudio":{"collines":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/31/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Eihel-collines.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"La maison est sur la colline.","en":"The house is on the hill.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"house, home"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"on"},{"g":"the / her"},null]},{"text":"Tu dois monter la colline.","en":"You must go up the hill.","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"must","l":"devoir"},{"g":"to go up, to climb"},{"g":"the / her"},null]},{"text":"Les collines étaient recouvertes de neige.","en":"The hills were covered with snow.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/28419","words":[{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"coated, covered","l":"recouvert"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"snow"}]},{"text":"Il se tient sur la colline.","en":"He is standing on the hill.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"to have","l":"tenir"},{"g":"on"},{"g":"the / her"},null]},{"text":"Je grimpai la colline.","en":"I walked up the hill.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to climb, climb up","l":"grimper"},{"g":"the / her"},null]}]}